Package: normals
Title: Climate Normals from Empirical, Fitted and Smoothed Distributions
Version: 2.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kyle", "Bocinsky", , "kyle.bocinsky@umontana.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Colin", "Brust", , "colin.brust@mso.umt.edu", role = "aut",
           comment = "normals 1.x")
  )
Description: Daily climate normals for any set of subjects (stations, zones
    or pixels): empirical, fitted and smoothed distributions through
    pluggable distribution families (the first is the zero-inflated gamma),
    percentiles and standardized anomalies, a persistence outlook for the
    rest of the year, and shared plot helpers. Reads and writes no storage.
